<title>HUNGARY: Hungary O/N rates end little changed at 23.125 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary O/N rates end little changed at 23.125 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates ended little changed in quiet trade on Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Rates ranged between 22.75 and 23.25 percent and ended at 23.125 percent, compared to a close of 23.25 percent on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It was a quiet day, as is usual on the second day of a new reserve period,&quot; said Gabor Liener of Unicbank. &quot;I expect little change tomorrow. If anything, there will be a slight fall.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +361 327 4040</p>
